      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "a1-de-modal-verbs-01",
        "slug": "a1-de-modal-verbs-grammar",
        "title": "Kannst du…?",
        "rule_summary": "With a modal verb, the modal is finite and the lexical infinitive goes to the end: Ich kann heute kommen.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "در جمله با فعل مدال، فعل اصلی به آخر می‌رود: «Ich kann Deutsch sprechen.»"
        },
        "examples": [
